{"title":"Friday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/925403876/0/marginalrevolution~Friday-assorted-links.html","date":1758900480000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://blog.jacobtrefethen.com/nih-and-nsf/?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">Five reforms for science funding</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.washingtonpost.com/entertainment/interactive/2025/dc-district-columbia-music-movies-art/?itid=hp-top-table-main_p001_f007\" target=\"_blank\">Canon of art works about Washington, D.C.</a> They forgot to list “No Way Out,” one of the best DC movies, with Gene Hackman.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/kingofthecoastt/status/1970942125845119275?s=61\" target=\"_blank\">Private equity in the hospital industry</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/jesusferna7026/status/1970825823125934376?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag\" target=\"_blank\">Slide deck for 1870-1914</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.economist.com/finance-and-economics/2025/09/23/how-to-spot-a-genius?giftId=9e411fd3-4dc6-40a5-a5c2-81b74573bb2e&amp;utm_campaign=gifted_article\" target=\"_blank\">The Economist on talent and spotting geniuses</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.construction-physics.com/p/how-common-is-accidental-invention?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=104058&amp;post_id=174456787&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">How common is accidental invention?</a></p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://openai.com/index/gdpval/\" target=\"_blank\">Evaluating LLMs on real world tasks</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Mick West, by the way, initially was dismissing “drones over Denmark” reports, he is not a reliable source rather a reflexive nay-sayer.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/friday-assorted-links-540.html\">Friday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/925403876/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/925403876/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/925403876/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/925403876/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/925403876/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/925403876/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/friday-assorted-links-540.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/friday-assorted-links-540.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/friday-assorted-links-540.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/frid